{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":87513,\"title\":\"Happy Traveller\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A unique travel show that combines selfie filming, POV, drone, social media interaction and more other nowadays filming approaches.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3xa7jfucJxPpaLWSBMTb8w1T25j.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6mXKBbfj2BgOFcyiih3BMM8Y6Wh.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2015,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":10,\"totalEpisodes\":280,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Skai\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GR\",\"name\":\"Greece\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-04-13\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2844022,\"name\":\"Eftyhis Bletsas\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2844022,\"name\":\"Eftyhis Bletsas\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2844023,\"name\":\"Electra Asteri\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lhwJYn0MDI781UC7xIlJhGoY5Zu.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"cFnqdkfYe6U\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"dsoCGKJOD7M\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"GfytNMkcIq4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":63064,\"title\":\"Bangkok Airport\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oOcKi7bXgb52TuFuSJrvTy8C7zq.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43947368421052635,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2361,\"title\":\"A Cook's Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cnimBXaFRyDPW5WH6XTUDSaAsAE.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62970,\"title\":\"Rick Steves' Europe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/slBdVxqcggV7vnFxm07vZjeNshJ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":246118,\"title\":\"Martin Compston's Norwegian Fling\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6MREBNelVLMKZs2kva0co6ctzpm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41500000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62991,\"title\":\"Bizarre Foods: Delicious Destinations\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xedJlK1UpDgsiEeJImjFi4Lbu4J.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41348314606741576,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63151,\"title\":\"Watt's World\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41276595744680855,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":246518,\"title\":\"On the Wings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i1ShFYjzlgJLZNeFJzV8G4tQShx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4123287671232877,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63144,\"title\":\"Kevin McCloud's Escape to the Wild\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4gHRlOokn9dLlt2yhn9vlJN7bkt.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.411764705882353,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":96684,\"title\":\"From City to City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jkDXTIMwFsoFt5SgtUKKV6Nrh3u.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41000000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":246119,\"title\":\"Into the Congo with Ben Fogle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qHs2KbIBk6yi93cuYaRT6dlq6DI.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40937500000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":245989,\"title\":\"An Optimist's Guide to the Planet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lplnZYo4Jg0KsgEMs3lVZwJum80.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40923076923076923,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62738,\"title\":\"Jamie's Great Britain\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1GX5fmRK1075HjUyZZctc37E5AF.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40882352941176475,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":7,\"seasonName\":\"Season 7\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wDzVIY9CyRK57x70kfvrl9OxhfY.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2020-09-05\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Crete - Lasithi (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"In the episode we see the first destination they visited after the lifting of the restrictive measures: the beautiful Crete. In previous episodes, the Happy Traveler had visited the prefectures of Chania and Rethymnon, but now it sets sail for the eastern side of the island and more specifically the prefecture of Lasithi. In the first part, our travelers visit the capital of the prefecture, Agios Nikolaos, with its emblematic lake and picturesque harbor and climb the impressive Lasithi plateau. They stay in Elounda and explore the beautiful bay with its picturesque harbors, golden coasts and traditional villages. They go to historic Spinalonga and reach the tip of Aforesmenos cape to see one of the most isolated historic lighthouses in Greece.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-05\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Lassithi part 2\",\"overview\":\"In the second part of the journey, our travelers see the Cha Gorge, Ierapetra and the surrounding area. They visit the island of Chrysi with the wonderful beach and the Mylonas waterfall. The journey to the prefecture of Lassithi continues around Sitia, with the impressive palm forest of Vai and the historic monastery of Toplou.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Faroe Islands part 1\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveller in the Faroe Islands! Eftyhis is taking his first trip abroad for this year, to one of the most isolated countries in Europe. The Faroe Islands archipelago, a country with 18 islands, is in the North Atlantic Ocean between Iceland, Scotland, and Norway. In the first part of the trip, he stays in a van, drives to fairy-tale landscapes, and sees amazing waterfalls and fjords.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Faroe Islands part 2\",\"overview\":\"In the second part of his trip, Eftyhis visits the largest of the country's 18 islands and explores the capital Torshavn. Strolling through the picturesque harbor and observes the colorful buildings reminiscent of Copenhagen and the traditional wooden houses that house the government. He goes to one of the most picturesque villages in the region to see the oldest surviving Catholic temple in the Faroe Islands, which is also the oldest building in the country. The next day he visits Mykines, the westernmost island of Faroe. He walks in the fog to reach one of the most important lighthouses in the North Atlantic. Along the way he sees the beautiful puffins up close, since on the island there is one of the largest colonies in the world. Returning to the settlement of the island, he tastes traditional fish soup and meets one of the ten permanent residents to find out where the island got its name.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-26\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Faroe Islands part 3\",\"overview\":\"On the third part of the journey to the isolated archipelago in the North Atlantic Ocean, Eftyhis drives his van to the east and northern Faroe Islands, crosses bridges and gets on a ferry to Kalsoy Island. She walks through one of the country's few forests in Kunoy Park, sees incredible landscapes, picturesque villages and admires the Kopakonan, the beautiful statue of a seal-woman, accompanied by a dark legend.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Faroe Islands part 4\",\"overview\":\"Eftyhis exploring the famous village Gjogv, which means gorge and took its name from its special natural port. He climbs an impressive ridge to see from above one of the country's most iconic fjords. He will admire the \\\"Giant\\\" and the \\\"Witch\\\", the two iconic rocks on the northern coast of the country and learn about the myth that connects these rocks with Iceland. Finally, he visits the double Waterfall Fossa which is also the largest in the country.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-10\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Mountainous Arcadia part 1\",\"overview\":\"Eftyhis and Electra visit one of the most beautiful and historic areas of Greece, mountainous Arcadia. In the first part, they explore the picturesque villages of Stemnitsa and Dimitsana and stay in a heavenly place surrounded by the fir trees. They visit the Hydromobility Museum which is an important tourist attraction and make a stop in the village of Lagadia. They learn the history of the place and taste traditional flavors. They admire amazing forests, visit small churches, and discover steep slopes.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Mountainous Arcadia part 2\",\"overview\":\"In the second part of the journey, they visit mountainous Vytina, the medieval Karytina, as well as the historic village of Limpovisi. They walk in the village where Theodoros Kolokotronis was origin of, enter the museum that has been built in his honor and rest for a while in the traditional café. They enjoy the natural beauties of the river Lousios, the gorge and the surrounding areas. Finally, they visit the Monastery of Timios Prodromos.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-24\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Northern Norway\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveller in Northern Norway, the northernmost part of Europe! Eftyhis passes through beautiful Norwegian landscapes and travels almost 1,500 kilometers in 48 hours, aiming to reach the famous northern cape. A route considered one of the top road trips in the world. He visits Tromso where the impressive Arctic Cathedral take place as well as the town of Alta with the famous carved 7,000-year-old cliffs. He drives to enchanting landscapes, passes amazing bridges, sees spectacular fjords, imposing waterfalls, strange beaches, picturesque villages, historical sights and temples, a dreamy sunrise and a fairy-tale sunset at Cape Nordkapp, the northernmost point of continental Europe.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-31\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Svalbard Archipelago\",\"overview\":\"Eftyhis travels to a special destination. Happy Traveller arrives at the Svalbard Archipelago, the closest point to the North Pole the show has reached so far.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-07\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Kastoria\",\"overview\":\"Eftyhis and Electra with their daughter, their dog, Hercules, and their equipment, get into a caravan and go to the town of furriers, Kastoria. Happy Traveller highlights the most important sights of Kastoria, the picturesque old town with its mansions, the lakeside settlement of Dispilio, the cave of Drakos, the top of Agios Athanasios as well as other idyllic locations of the wider region such as Nestorio and the forest of Mesopotamia. This trip will be special not only because of the beautiful destination, but also because it is the first time that the company travels in a motorhome.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Southern Crete - Irakleio\",\"overview\":\"Eftychis and Electra travel to Crete and explore the southern side of the prefecture of Heraklion. They go to the area of ​​Messara, Phaistos and Matala, are fascinated by the traditional villages of the area and travel us to the beautiful landscapes with the vast olive groves. They visit monasteries, but also a small church with amazing views, which every true traveler in the area wants to visit. They continue their search reaching the picturesque village of Zaros with its lake and the mountains of the imposing Psiloritis. Finally, they walk to the impressive Agiofarago and reach the enchanting red beach. The wild beauty of Crete, at its best! Happy Traveler in South Crete, on Saturday, November 21 at 17.40, at SKAI.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-21\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Cyprus - Paphos\",\"overview\":\"This week at Happy Traveler, Eftychis and Electra travel to the island of Aphrodite, the beloved Cyprus. They explore the province of Paphos and admire impressive landscapes, historical sites with enormous archaeological value, picturesque villages, paradise sites, the picturesque port of Paphos and its beautiful center. They are enchanted by the Coral Bay, go to the baths of Aphrodite and Adonis and \\\"feel like gods for a while\\\", and visit the most interesting villages of the area, such as Pomos, Episkopi, Pegeia and Gyalia. Finally, they walk at the Kremmiotis waterfall in Crete Terra and are impressed by the tombs of the Kings but also by Petra tou Romiou, on the beach, where the goddess Aphrodite emerged through the waves. Happy Traveler in Cyprus, in the Province of Paphos, on Saturday, November 28 at 17.40.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-11-28\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Evros\",\"overview\":\"This week, Happy Traveler travels to one of the most remote areas of Greece, Evros. Eftychis and Electra visit the beautiful Alexandroupolis with the emblematic lighthouse and walk its streets. They go to Feres with the historic church of Panagia Kosmosoteira, in the Delta of Evros where they see flamingos, in Dadia with the impressive virgin forest where they watch rare birds of prey, in Tychero with its picturesque lake, in Lefkimmi with the fossil forest, in Sou the long history of silk weaving, in Didymoteicho with its emblematic castle, in Orestiada with the impressive square and the impeccable road construction and in Kastanies with the river Arda that creates a scene of incomparable natural beauty. They reach Ormenio with the historic train station and explore the picturesque remote villages at the northern tip of our country. An episode in nature, in one of the most unexplored travel treasures of our country. Happy Traveler in Evros, on Saturday, December 5 at 17.40.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Kefalonia (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler travel to beautiful Kefalonia.They start their journey from the famous Fiskardo where they arrive by boat.After a walk in the picturesque settlement,they get in the car and head to the center of the island,in the village of Angonas where they are hosted in a beautiful house.Then,they go to enjoy a magical sunset on the beach of Myrtos.The next day,they visit the Monastery of Agios Gerasimos and the castle of Agios Georgios.They explore Argostoli bit by bit walking in the picturesque alleys,go for a walk on the bridge of Devosetos and continue with an electric skate to the impressive lighthouse of Agios Theodoros.A trip without activity is not possible for the Happy Traveler,so Eftychis enters in 4x4 and explores the most inaccessible parts of the area reaching the highest point of Kefalonia,the top of Mount Ainos.Finally,as a family they get on a boat and go boating in the bay of Myrtos to dive in impressive beaches and in a very impressive cave with a large inner beach.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Kefalonia (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"For the sixth largest island in Greece,one episode is not enough,which is why our travelers dedicate another one on Saturday,December 19th.In this episode,they visit Lixouri and the lunar beach Xi.Next stop,Kounopetra and then reach Vatsa beach,the village of Havriata and the famous monastery of Kipouraion.As for the beaches of the island,they can not miss the beaches Petanoi and Platia Ammos.With their visit to the settlement of Agia Efimia,Skala and Poros,they listen even more to the traditions of the island.In the surrounding area,they see Lake Abythos which is the only one on the whole island.The picturesque Assos with its colorful houses and its emblematic castle that is suitable for hiking in nature is in order.The magic in Kefalonia continues after the couple visits the impressive lake cave of Melissani and the cave Drogarati.A walk in Sami and the famous Antisamos beach uniquely close an episode full of beauties on one of the most beautiful islands of the Ionian Sea\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-12-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Mountainous Arcadia (Part 3)\",\"overview\":\"Eftychis and Electra continue their travels in 2021 and we travel with them through SKAI TV. First stop for the new year, Eastern Mountainous Arcadia and the villages of Parnon, on Saturday, January 16 at 17.40. The journey starts from Tripoli and after a brief mention of the two strangest churches that exist in Arcadia and have never been seen by our travelers, they ascend to the Parnon mountain range, in the area of ​​Kynouria. They explore picturesque villages such as Ano Doliana, Agios Petros, Platanos and Kastanitsa, meet hospitable inhabitants, taste local flavors, see impressive landscapes and places with a long history and unparalleled natural beauty. Happy Traveler in Kynouria, Arcadia, Saturday, January 16 at 17.40\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-16\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Austria in a campervan (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"On Saturday, January 23 at 17.40, Happy Traveler invites viewers to a different journey in Austria, through SKAI TV. The show has visited parts of the country again, but this time, Eftychis rents a caravan and travels by road in the heart of Europe. It leads from Vienna to Salzburg, Mozart's birthplace and at the same time one of the most beautiful cities in Europe. Admire the river Danube, the picturesque village of Melk with the iconic Abbey and passes by fairytale waterfalls and lakes and small towns, where the inhabitants have completely different rhythms. A special journey, in the era of the coronavirus and the pandemic, with empty streets in the cities and a melancholy scene that reminds us that everything has changed in terms of travel and transportation. Nevertheless, an impressive journey to a beautiful country, which took place last December. Happy Traveler in Austria, on Saturday, January 23 at 17.40, at SKAI\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-23\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Austria in a campervan (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"In the previous episode, Happy Traveler and Eftychis embarked on an epic caravan trip to Austria and SKAI viewers enjoyed images of incredible beauty. On Saturday, January 30 at 17.40, the trek continues and is even more exciting. Eftychis leads to fairytale snowy areas and sees icy lakes and impressive gorges in the province of Upper Austria. He walks in white forests with thick snow falling around him, visits Hallstatt, one of the most beautiful villages in the world, and tries to escape from a huge maze in the shape of a foot. Happy Traveler in Austria, Part B, on Saturday, January 30 at 17.40, at SKAI\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-01-30\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Elis (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler travels to the Peloponnese and Eftychis and Electra visit the prefecture of Ilia. In the first part of the trip, they enjoy the Kotychi lagoon, a place of unique beauty. They make a short stop at the dam of Pinios and visit the village of Lampeia, which is resorted to by all those who want a little more coolness in the summer. One of the top places they see is the Foloi Forest, while they also go to Chlemoutsi Castle, the Baths of Kyllini and reach the beach of Loutra. They continue their journey, stopping in Amaliada, walking in the famous and tropical Kourouta and walking in Gastouni, a town in western Ilia. The day ends with one of the most impressive sunsets you can see on Greek soil. The first part of the trip in the prefecture of Ilia closes with a passage through Zacharo and a visit to Lake Caiaphas with its beautiful natural landscape and historic baths.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-06\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Elis (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler continues its journey in the Western Peloponnese. In this episode, Eftychis and Electra go hiking at Neda waterfall, one of the few rivers in Greece that has a female name and separates the prefecture of Ilia from the prefecture of Messinia. However, they also visit the lesser known Nemouta waterfall at the eastern end of the prefecture. They see the imposing temple of Apollo the Auxiliary, perhaps the best-preserved ancient Greek temple. They walk in the traditional stone-built mountain village of Andritsaina, pass through Pyrgos and end up in the area of ​​ancient Olympia to see up close the emblematic archeological site. Happy Traveler in Ilia, Part B ', on Saturday, February 13 at 17.40\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-13\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Lefkada (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"In the heart of winter comes a dose of summer. Happy Traveler travels to the Ionian and specifically to Lefkada. A trip made by Eftychis and Electra last summer and will be completed in two episodes. In the first part, they explore the city of Lefkada in the north and lead to the southern end where the emblematic lighthouse is located. They visit the most famous beaches of the island, Porto Katsiki and Gremni. They get to know the picturesque mountain village of Exanthia, reach as far as Englouvi with its delicious dishes and go up to the old NATO base located right next door, to admire the unique view. Happy Traveler in Lefkada, Part A ', on Saturday, February 20 at 17.40\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-20\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Lefkada (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"An episode in beautiful Lefkada is not enough. That is why Happy Traveler at SKAI continues its journey to the magical Ionian island on Saturday, February 27 at 17.40. Eftychis and Electra take a walk in Nydri and reach the impressive waterfall. They go by boat around Scorpio and arrive in Meganisi to visit Vathi. They stop at Vassiliki in the south of the island, in the picturesque village of Karya, in Agios Nikitas and finally in Kathisma, from where they enjoy one of the most magical sunsets of the Ionian. Happy Traveler in Lefkada, Part B ', on Saturday, February 27 at 17.40\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-02-27\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Costa Rica (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler to Costa Rica.A trip to the green country of Central America with the hospitable inhabitants,the impressive tropical forests,the rich biodiversity and the heavenly beaches!A trip to the land of pure life:Pura Vida!The first part,on Saturday,March 6 at 17.40.Eftychis departs from icy Thessaloniki for a transatlantic voyage to the \\\"rich coast\\\",the exotic Costa Rica.In the first episode,he explores the capital San Jose and sees the most important sights,such as the Old Post Office and the National Theater as well as the picturesque central market.Then he starts a roadtrip in the countryside to experience the wild natural beauty of the country and stays in a traditional hostel in nature.Go to the area of ​​the active volcano Arenal where you swim in the impressive Fortuna waterfall,meet the strange Koati animals and walk in the rainforest crossing the famous suspension bridges of the country.Local flavors and images from wildlife documentaries on an unforgettable journey.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-06\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Costa Rica (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"In the previous episode, Happy Traveler began its journey in Costa Rica. In the green country of Central America that has no army but hospitable people. On Saturday, March 13, at 17.40, at SKAI, Eftychis continues his amazing journey in the country, which impressed him with its tropical forests and paradise beaches. It runs even further inland and explores the Tenorio Volcano National Park with its blue river (Rio Celeste). It walks to the impressive waterfall and the springs with the characteristic blue color. It then heads to the Monteverde Rainforest, one of Central America's richest biodiversity forests. There, in addition to hiking in nature, he also does zip line, one of the most popular travel activities in Costa Rica. In this episode, he sees sluggards, iguanas, monkeys and on a night stroll in the jungle he encounters tiny red-eyed frogs, glowing scorpions and tarantulas. Happy Traveler in Costa Rica, Part B, on Saturday, March 13 at 5:40 p.m.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-13\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Costa Rica (Part 3)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler's impressive trip to Costa Rica ends on Saturday, March 20 at 17.40, at SKAI. Eftychis continues his tour in one of the most beautiful countries of Central America and knows better his \\\"other\\\" face with the amazing beaches and golden beaches. It runs south along the west coast and overlooks the town of Punta Arenas with its iconic lighthouse. He crosses the Crocodile Bridge to see these special and terrifying reptiles from above. The trek continues to the famous Yaco beach, where it sees the ruby ​​sun disappear in the vast Pacific Ocean and ends at the fairytale Manuel Antonio National Park, which although the smallest park in the country, is one of the most popular and for many the most beautiful Costa Rica. There he sees endless sweet monkeys and one of the most dreamy beaches in Central America. Happy Traveler in Costa Rica, Part C, on Saturday, March 20 at 5:40 p.m.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-03-20\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Mountainous Achaea - Kalavryta\",\"overview\":\"On Saturday, April 3 at 17.40, Happy Travelers travel by road within Greece and go to mountainous Achaia and Kalavrita. They learn the history of the martyred town, take a walk on the main pedestrian street and visit the museum of the Kalavrita Holocaust and the hill outside the city, where one of the darkest pages in the history of Greece was written during World War II. Then, they go to the historic monastery of Agia Lavra and the impressive monument of the revolution of 1821. On this trip, which took place last summer, they taste local flavors that go crazy, lead to unique landscapes, reach a fairytale waterfall, visit the impressive , in natural beauty, Lake Tsivlou and are guided to the impressive Observatory of Helmos. A visit to Kalavrita could not but include a walk on the cog railway and a walk in the gorge of Vouraikos, one of the leading hiking trails in Greece.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Ithaca\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler travels to the Ionian Sea and stops at the island of Odysseus, Ithaca. In this episode, Eftychis and Electra see unique beaches, swim in crystal clear waters and taste traditional flavors of the island. Our traveling couple starts wandering from the main coastal settlement of the island, Vathi, enchanted by its picturesque alleys and talking to the locals. By traditional boat they go to the dreamy and famous beach of the island, Gidaki and then, with an inflatable they reach the wild north coast to swim in Afales. The exploration also has impressive caves, strange rock formations, places with incredible views and places of incomparable natural beauty. The journey of the show includes both the north and the south side of the island. Our travelers are guided to the Holy Monastery of Katharaion, Anogi, Exogi and Kioni. In Frikes they stop for traditional food, in Perachori for delicious walnut pie while in Stavros they try the most famous dessert of the island.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-10\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Kilkis\",\"overview\":\"Another Happy Traveler in Greece on Saturday, April 17th. Eftychis and Electra start from their headquarters, Thessaloniki and make a trip to the neighboring Akriti law, Kilkis. They explore the city of Kilkis with the picturesque hill and the cave of Agios Georgios. Then, they go to Lake Doirani, to the imposing monument of the First World War but also to the surrounding villages, such as Mouries with the characteristic railway station. Finally, they pass by Eidomeni and visit the historic village of Skra with its hospitable inhabitants, the emerald lake and the impressive waterfalls. Happy Traveler in Kilkis on Saturday, April 17 at 17.40\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-04-17\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Mexico (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler dynamically starts the journeys of May and takes us to Central America, to one of the most charming countries in the world. On Saturday, May 8, at 5:40 p.m., Eftychis travels to Mexico, specifically to the Yucatan Peninsula off the coast of the Caribbean Sea. In the first part of the trip it lands on the famous tourist resort of Cancun and tours its neighborhoods, markets and long sandy beaches. Next, visit Chichen Itza, one of the most iconic Mayan ancient cities in the heart of the Yucatan Peninsula. The program also includes swimming in \\\"Cenote\\\", one of the thousands of natural pools that exist in this country and attract travelers from around the world. Happy Traveler in Mexico, Part A on Saturday, May 8 at 5:40 p.m.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-08\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Mexico (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"Eftychis continues his fascinating journey to the charming country of Central America and SKAI viewers have the opportunity to watch his tour of the Mayan Riviera. A road trip starts from Cancun and goes to Tulum and Playa del Carmen. It sees impressive Mayan temples in stunning locations and exotic beaches full of people. Wander through a maze of underground caves full of water and try even more traditional Mexican food. And the trip to Mexico does not stop here… Happy Traveler in Mexico, Part B on Saturday, May 15 at 17.40\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Mexico (Part 3)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler's thrilling journey to the charming country of Central America, Mexico, is coming to an end. In this episode, SKAI viewers have the opportunity to watch Eftychis' latest explorations on the Yucatan Peninsula. She goes to the city of Valladolid with colonial architecture, to the ancient Mayan city, Coba, to the Isla Mujeres (island of the women) in the Caribbean, off Cancun and visits a cave that looks like the Melissania Cave, but not Kefalonia as he expected! Happy Traveler in Mexico, Part C, on Saturday, May 22 at 5:40 p.m.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bOf2uNWuJbzUOsAgWaeQSycfpty.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-22\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Uganda (Part 1)\",\"overview\":\"One of the most special trips of this season is the one made by Happy Traveler in Africa and specifically in Uganda. Experiences and images from this exciting journey, are conveyed by Eftychis, starting from Saturday, May 29 at 17.40, at SKAI.\\n\\nIn the first part, he explores Entebbe, where the international airport and the rainforest of the Botanical Garden, which was the setting for the movie Tarzan of the 1940s, are located. Then go to the bustling capital Kampala with its 7 hills, bustling markets and historic sights. Finally, in this episode, he visits the town of Jinja on the shores of Lake Victoria for a boating at the point where the Nile River begins.\\n\\nHappy Traveler in Uganda, Part A\\n\\nSaturday, May 29 at 5:40 p.m.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s2NGRoDcCbi75fFwm6bfTOEO7Qh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-05-29\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Uganda (Part 2)\",\"overview\":\"On Saturday,June 5 at 17.40,the journey continues to SKAI with more exciting images and experiences.Eftychis starts a roadtrip to admire the most impressive national parks in the country with rich natural wealth and wildlife.It goes to one of the points where the equator crosses Uganda and continues to Lake Mburo National Park,where it boats to see the dozens of hippos that live there.It then ascends to the country's mountains in one of Africa's most pristine and unspoiled forests,the inaccessible Buidi Forest,home to the largest mountain gorilla population on Earth.One of the rarest and most beautiful mammals on the planet,which Eftychis is pleased to see up close in one of the top travel experiences he has ever had on this show.In the Buddy forest,he meets natives of the Batua tribe who will host him in their village to see how their daily life is and a part of their traditional customs and traditions.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/acw42SDqArtNZjGYhfH7HYv2f7E.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":35,\"name\":\"Uganda (Part 3)\",\"overview\":\"Happy Traveler is in Uganda and on Saturday 12 June at 17.40, completes its journey to the fascinating country of Africa. Eftychis, through the screen of SKAI, brings us his amazing images and experiences from the last part of the journey to the most remarkable natural sights of the country. He visits Queen Elizabeth National Park, where he goes boating and sees hundreds of animals such as elephants, buffaloes and hippos living freely in nature. After spending the night in a hostel in the national park, he embarks on a safari in the African savannah and sees spectacular felines. Next stop, the Kibale National Park where he hike in the tropical jungle to see chimpanzees up close. Taste local flavors, enjoy lake landscapes in volcanic craters, admire an impressive waterfall and visit a traditional food market. Eftychis completes his trip to Uganda with the best impressions, on Saturday, June 12 at 17.40.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xKokuwrbr1SefxuwlzKSoALfH5Q.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":36,\"name\":\"Uganda (Part 4)\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mCENu3ce2yF9s8KwwsmCCYUEFYc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2021-06-26\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-07-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}